-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
--  CBF/CBV physiological models for acute stroke case categories
--  and post-treatment / 2-3 day progression states.
--
--  UUID range: f223-f23c  (prefix c51c1e5f-5cc1-4b77-8832-2d10cc97)
--  All models clone model_Hr_csf_icp. Use plot_Hr_csf_icp to visualise.
--
--  Key output variables for CBF/CBV interpretation:
--    Q_As_CaBV  — cerebral arterial inflow (CBF proxy)
--    V_CaBV     — cerebral arterial blood volume (CBV proxy)
--    P_CaBV     — cerebral arterial pressure
--    P_SAS      — intracranial pressure (ICP)
--    Q_CaBV_Vt  — cerebral venous outflow
--    amp_P_SAS  — ICP pulse amplitude
--    Q_SAS_Spinal — cranio-spinal CSF flow (CSF stroke volume basis)
--
--  Acute models (f223-f232): 16 distinct pathophysiological states at presentation.
--  Post-treatment / progression models (f233-f23c): 10 states at 2-3 days.
-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

